flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Set ADC stabilization delay value]

    B --> C[Set ADC control pin HIGH]

    C --> D[Delay for ADC stabilization]

    D --> E[Initialize raw ADC value to zero]

    E --> F[Set sample index i to 0]

    F --> G{i less than battery samples}

    G -- Yes --> H[Read battery ADC value]
    H --> I[Add ADC value to raw total]
    I --> J[Increment sample index i]
    J --> G

    G -- No --> K[Divide raw total by number of samples]

    K --> L[Set ADC control pin LOW]

    L --> M[Calculate battery voltage]

    M --> N([Return voltage])
